      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "**Note**: Each sub-array must contain the same number of elements.",
      "contextAfter": "```None\n   let xValues = [[1, 2],\n                  [3, 4]] as [[Float]]\n   let yValues = [[5, 6],\n                  [7, 8]] as [[Float]]\n\n   let context = try BNNSGraph.makeContext {\n       builder in\n\n       let x = builder.constant(values: xValues)\n       let y = builder.constant(values: yValues)\n\n       let z = x.matmul(other: y)\n\n       return [z] // On return, `z` equals `[19.0, 22.0, 43.0, 50.0]`.\n   }\n```",
      "documentTitle": "constant(values:rowMajor:)",
